Review follow-ups: the audio pipe names no connection, so a host keying on the
requestId keeps ids unique across its control connections while asks are
pending. An ask whose connection closed unanswered records nothing. A present
requestId outside the domain refuses the resume. Installers never replace an
equal 0.2.10, so pin that 0.2.11 is newer.

